254
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:40,760
Oof. This shit goes to your head, huh?

255
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:42,040
Yeah, it really does.

256
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:44,240
- I'll go get more.
- Okay.

257
