and a ton of brand deals.

316
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:38,160
I fucking told you! Didn't I tell you?

317
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:39,200
You happy?

318
00:23:39,280 --> 00:23:43,240
Realize your fuckin' tantrums
have consequences, you fucking child!

319
