470
00:37:15,440 --> 00:37:17,600
No. No, no, no. Iván!

471
00:37:17,680 --> 00:37:19,560
Iván!

472
00:37:19,640 --> 00:37:21,520
You're so jealous,
you'd cockblock your daughter?

473
00:37:21,600 --> 00:37:23,440
